Spoiler time...

To get out of the castle to the next level down, use the trapdoors in the
eastern corridor. If you got in by using knock on the drawbridge, it should
still be down when you want to leave, and should stay down until the
character dies. Now if for some reason the drawbridge is up again, try using
the knock on it again from the inside, or use the backdoor past the
trapdoors to leave.  Of course the only prob. with this is that unless you
have levitation or water-walking boots, you'll never make it past the moat.
Of course a wand of cold can rectify that.




